00:27:08,100 --> 00:27:08,600
Lived

513
00:27:08,600 --> 00:27:09,230
OK

514
00:27:09,230 --> 00:27:12,590
So one, four and seven are looking better than 10

515
00:27:12,590 --> 00:27:14,230
right now

